      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft knit sweater fabric with a textured cable pattern; exact fiber content was not visible from the blocked vendor page.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A cozy cream matching sweater for moms, dads, girls, and boys, made for cool-weather photos and family outings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Cable Horse pairs an ivory cable knit with a small red horse patch at the chest.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Long sleeves, crew neckline, ribbed trim, cable texture, and a relaxed pullover sweater shape. Pants, boots, scarves, hats, and accessories are styling only.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, turn inside out, line dry flat, do not bleach, and use a cool iron only if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Children 1-2Y through 9-10Y and adults S through 4XL.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Size Chart - Sweater</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n<th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Sleeve or Skirt (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>7.5-10 kg / 16.5346-22.0462 lbs</td>\n<td>75-85 cm / 29.5276-33.4646 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.5591 in</td>\n<td>26 cm / 10.2362 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.5591 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.5591 in</td>\n<td>34 cm / 13.3858 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>10-13.5 kg / 22.0462-29.7624 lbs</td>\n<td>85-95 cm / 33.4646-37.4016 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1339 in</td>\n<td>28 cm / 11.0236 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1339 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1339 in</td>\n<td>37 cm / 14.5669 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>13.5-17 kg / 29.7624-37.4785 lbs</td>\n<td>95-105 cm / 37.4016-41.3386 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7087 in</td>\n<td>30 cm / 11.811 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7087 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7087 in</td>\n<td>41 cm / 16.1417 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>17-20.5 kg / 37.4785-45.1947 lbs</td>\n<td>105-115 cm / 41.3386-45.2756 in</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.2835 in</td>\n<td>32 cm / 12.5984 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.2835 in</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.2835 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3228 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>20.5-24 kg / 45.1947-52.9109 lbs</td>\n<td>115-125 cm / 45.2756-49.2126 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.8583 in</td>\n<td>34 cm / 13.3858 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.8583 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.8583 in</td>\n<td>47 cm / 18.5039 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>24-27.5 kg / 52.9109-60.627 lbs</td>\n<td>125-135 cm / 49.2126-53.1496 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4331 in</td>\n<td>36 cm / 14.1732 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4331 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4331 in</td>\n<td>50 cm / 19.685 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27.5-32.5 kg / 60.627-71.6501 lbs</td>\n<td>135-145 cm / 53.1496-57.0866 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0079 in</td>\n<td>38 cm / 14.9606 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0079 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0079 in</td>\n<td>53 cm / 20.8661 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32.5-37.5 kg / 71.6501-82.6732 lbs</td>\n<td>145-155 cm / 57.0866-61.0236 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.5827 in</td>\n<td>40 cm / 15.748 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.5827 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.5827 in</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22.0472 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>40-50 kg / 88.1848-110.231 lbs</td>\n<td>150-160 cm / 59.0551-62.9921 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9449 in</td>\n<td>57 cm / 22.4409 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9449 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2205 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8346 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>50-60 kg / 110.231-132.277 lbs</td>\n<td>155-165 cm / 61.0236-64.9606 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7323 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2283 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7323 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0079 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24.0157 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>60-70 kg / 132.277-154.323 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 62.9921-66.9291 in</td>\n<td>112 cm / 44.0945 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24.0157 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>112 cm / 44.0945 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.3701 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.1969 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70-80 kg / 154.323-176.37 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 64.9606-68.8976 in</td>\n<td>116 cm / 45.6693 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8031 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>116 cm / 45.6693 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9449 in</td>\n<td>67 cm / 26.378 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>80-90 kg / 176.37-198.416 lbs</td>\n<td>170-180 cm / 66.9291-70.8661 in</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2441 in</td>\n<td>65 cm / 25.5906 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2441 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5197 in</td>\n<td>71 cm / 27.9528 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90-100 kg / 198.416-220.462 lbs</td>\n<td>175-185 cm / 68.8976-72.8346 in</td>\n<td>122 cm / 48.0315 in</td>\n<td>67 cm / 26.378 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>122 cm / 48.0315 in</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3071 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1339 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 4XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100-110 kg / 220.462-242.508 lbs</td>\n<td>175-185 cm / 68.8976-72.8346 in</td>\n<td>124 cm / 48.8189 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.1654 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>124 cm / 48.8189 in</td>\n<td>112 cm / 44.0945 in</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.315 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Cable Horse brings a polished winter-family look into one easy sweater silhouette. The cream cable knit keeps the outfit classic, while the red horse patch gives every size a playful shared detail that reads clearly in family photos.</p>\n<p>The attached chart publishes sweater measurements for child sizes 80-150 and adult sizes S-4XL. Baby romper rows from the same chart are excluded from this tops listing, and the styled pants, boots, scarf, hats, and accessories are not included.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy matching sweater:</strong> One cream cable-knit pullover for children and adults.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready chest patch:</strong> The red horse motif keeps the family set coordinated without feeling too loud.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cool-weather styling:</strong> Long sleeves and ribbed trim make it easy for fall, winter, travel, and holiday photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Wide adult range:</strong> Adult sizes run from S through 4XL based on the attached vendor chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Honest product scope:</strong> This listing covers the sweaters only; baby rompers and styled bottoms are excluded.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose each family member's size and build a cozy matching look for portraits, trips, and everyday cold-weather plans together.</p>",
